# Hendo Academy Website Structure

## Overview
The Hendo Academy website is focused on promoting the study of Syriac and the history of Nasranies of India. The site contains educational content, articles, and tools for learning Syriac.

## Main Pages
- [index.html](mdc:index.html) - Main homepage with sections for About, Activities, Syriac Editor, and Contact
- [articles/index.html](mdc:articles/index.html) - Articles index page listing all available articles

## Articles
- [articles/turgama.html](mdc:articles/turgama.html) - Article featuring parallel Syriac and Malayalam text of the Turgama d'evangelion (a liturgical text)

## Styling and Components
The website uses a consistent styling approach with:
- Responsive design (mobile and desktop layouts)
- Color scheme with primary (#8a3c3c), secondary (#d4a445), and tertiary (#3c5c8a) colors
- Custom Syriac font (Karshon) for displaying Syriac text
- Parallel text display components for showing Syriac and Malayalam translations side by side

## Features
- Navigation menu with mobile-responsive toggle
- Article layouts with metadata (author, date)
- Social media integration in footer
- Google Analytics integration

## Technical Notes
- Uses jQuery for DOM manipulation
- Custom fonts for Syriac text rendering
- Mobile-first responsive design with CSS media queries
